      "description_en": "The type of the trigger. Valid values:\n\n*   `ALL`: a trigger that supports both tags and regular expressions.\n*   `TAG_LIST`: a tag-based trigger.\n*   `TAG_REG_EXP`: a regular expression-based trigger.\n",
      "description_zh": "触发器类型，取值：\n- `ALL`：全部触发\n- `TAG_LIST`：Tag触发\n- `TAG_REG_EXP`：表达式触发\n\n",
      "example": "ALL",
      "help_en": "The type of the trigger. Valid values:\n\n*   `ALL`: a trigger that supports both tags and regular expressions.\n*   `TAG_LIST`: a tag-based trigger.\n*   `TAG_REG_EXP`: a regular expression-based trigger",
      "help_zh": "触发器类型，取值：\n- `ALL`：全部触发\n- `TAG_LIST`：Tag触发\n- `TAG_REG_EXP`：表达式触发",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "trigger_type",
      "options": [
        "--trigger-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "TriggerType",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "description_en": "The image tag based on which the trigger is set.\n\n> \n\n*   If `TriggerType` is set to `ALL`, `TriggerTag` can be set to a string or an array, for example, `*`.\n\n*   If `TriggerType` is set to `TAG_LIST`, `TriggerTag` must be set to an array, for example, `[1]`.\n*   If `TriggerType` is set to `TAG_REG_EXP`, `TriggerTag` must be set to a string, for example, `*`.\n",
      "description_zh": "触发触发器的镜像版本。\n\n> - `TriggerType`为`ALL`，`TriggerTag`可以为任意字符串，示例`*`。\n- `TriggerType`为`TAG_LIST`，`TriggerTag`为数组，示例`[1]`。\n- `TriggerType`为`TAG_REG_EXP`，`TriggerTag`为字符串，示例`*`。\n\n\n",
      "example": "[1]",
      "help_en": "The image tag based on which the trigger is set.\n\n> \n\n*   If `TriggerType` is set to `ALL`, `TriggerTag` can be set to a string or an array, for example, `*`.\n\n*   If `TriggerType` is set to `TAG_LIST`, `TriggerTag` must be set to an array, for example, `[1]`.\n*   If `TriggerType` is set to `TAG_REG_EXP`, `TriggerTag` must be set to a string, for example, `*`",
      "help_zh": "触发触发器的镜像版本。\n\n> - `TriggerType`为`ALL`，`TriggerTag`可以为任意字符串，示例`*`。\n- `TriggerType`为`TAG_LIST`，`TriggerTag`为数组，示例`[1]`。\n- `TriggerType`为`TAG_REG_EXP`，`TriggerTag`为字符串，示例`*`",
